# CR 800.4a, 614.1d: "a player" is a player in the game. In a game of three Bot3 starts at 5 life, the only player with 13 or
# less, and concedes in turn 1's first main phase after both others pass. Bot1's Bleeding Woods then enters tapped: the
# player who has left no longer has a life total to count.

[Life]
Bot3: 5

[Bot1 Deck]
Bleeding Woods
Forest x19

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest x20

[Bot3 Deck]
Forest x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot3.Concede
Bot1.Hand.Bleeding Woods.Play
? Bot1.Battlefield.Bleeding Woods.Tapped = true

[Expect]
Bot3.Status = Lost
Bot1.Battlefield.Bleeding Woods.Tapped = true
